  "description" : "\"God of Eternity\" is adapted from the novel of the same name by Yuewen Platinum author Feitianyu. Eight hundred years ago, Zhang Ruochen, the only son of Emperor Ming, possessed unparalleled talent but was killed by his childhood sweetheart, Princess Chi Yao. Eight hundred years later, he was reborn into the body of Zhang Ruochen, the useless ninth prince of Yunwu County. This body was weak and sickly, devoid of spiritual power, and he and his mother, Consort Lin, suffered constant bullying in the county prince`s mansion. After awakening his memories, Zhang Ruochen vowed revenge against Empress Chi Yao, who was now the ruler of the Kunlun Realm, while also protecting Consort Lin, who had given him maternal love. He awakened the Divine Martial Mark of Time and Space, and through his past life`s experience and hard work, he grew rapidly. After winning the year-end assessment, he experienced battles in the Martial Market Arena and ambushes at the Underworld Gate, eventually entering the Martial Market Academy for further studies.\nsource: bangumi.tv/googletranslate",
